N        EQU   3
U        EQU   1000
V        EQU   1010
W        EQU   1020
         ORIG  3000
START    ENN1  N         S1. Initialize. j ← 0.
         JOV   OFLO      Ensure that overflow is off.
1H       J1Z   DONE      Terminate if j = n.
         ENTA  1         Set k ← 0.
2H       ADD   U+N,1     S2. Subtract digits.
         SUB   V+N,1     Compute uj − vj + k + b.
         ADD   WM1
         STA   W+N,1     (May be minus zero)
         INC1  1         S3. Loop on j. j ← j + 1.
         JOV   1B        If overflow, set k ← 0.
         ENTA  0         Otherwise set k ← −1.
         J1N   2B        Back to S2 if j < n.
         HLT   5         (Error, v > u)
DONE     HLT
OFLO     HLT   1
BYTE     EQU   1(4:4)
1H       EQU   1(1:1)
WM1      CON   1B-1,BYTE-1(1:1)  Word size minus one
         END   START
